  38          /* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  39            compute_syndrome_from_bus
  40            ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  41            Computes S = H * x^T on-the-fly using bitwise XOR.
  42           
  43            The H1-type matrix column i (1-indexed) equals i in binary.
  44            So: syndrome = XOR of all column indices (j+1) for bits j that are set in x.
  45           
  46            Implementation: Loop through bits 0..14 of bus_state. For each set bit at
  47            position j, XOR the syndrome with (j+1).
